<!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
    <div class="three soccer-page-three">
      <div class='ash-insta-line'>
      <ul class='insta-list'>
    </div>
      <p><br>
        Growing up in Reading, Massachusetts, I was introduced to competitiveness at a young age. With some of the highest ranking school systems and sports programs in the state, I was able to develop a strong work ethic and a drive to succeed. I was fortunate enough to have the opportunity to play hockey and baseball at a high level, which taught me the importance of teamwork, discipline, and perseverance.
        <br><br>
        Software development became my focus in my early 20s while working in IT and software testing. The more I saw what could be accomplished with code, the more driven I became to learn. I spent countless hours teaching myself programming and web development outside of work, turning a growing interest into a career dedicated to building impactful digital experiences.
        <br><br>
    </div>
